<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LOMU FITR TO FACE ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LOMU FITR TO FACE ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jonah Lomu was declared fit to play for New Zealand Barbarians against England on Saturday.</p>
<p>He had been rated only 50-50 on Friday because of a groin injury.</p>
</text>
